&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;You have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;A degree in computer science, electrical engineering, automotive engineering, embedded systems, a comparable qualification, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;Several years of professional embedded software development experience with strong Embedded C skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;Practical project experience with AUTOSAR Classic, ASW or SWC development, RTE, BSW interfaces and ARXML&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;Experience with at least one established AUTOSAR development or configuration toolchain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;Strong practical knowledge of ISO 26262 at software level and ASIL-oriented development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;Experience deriving and implementing Software Safety RequirementsPractical experience with QM and safety separation, safety monitoring, fault handling and safe-state mechanisms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;Knowledge of safety-oriented software architecture, static analysis, structured reviews and verification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;An evidence-based approach to technical documentation and an excellent standard of written and spoken English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
