&lt;div&gt;Experience with ASIL-B, safety islands, dedicated safety controllers or heterogeneous multicore platforms&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Knowledge of Freedom from Interference, memory and timing protection, MISRA C, watchdogs and End-to-End protection&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with FMEA, FTA, FMEDA, HARA support or safety-case preparation&lt;/div&gt;
