&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with Vector DaVinci, Elektrobit tresos, ETAS ISOLAR, CANoe or CANalyzer&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Knowledge of DEM, DCM, UDS, PduR, COM or related AUTOSAR modules&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Knowledge of Automotive SPICE, IEC 61508, Performance Level or SIL-related development&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with safety-relevant HMI, touch or display functions and NXP i.MX or comparable ARM platforms&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Adaptive AUTOSAR knowledge in addition to AUTOSAR Classic&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
