&lt;div class=&quot;text-element editable-element editable-text-element&quot; data-v-b92e6724=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;Senior Embedded Platform &amp;amp; Linux Engineer FREELANCER (f/m/d) - Munich&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;You will:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;text-element editable-element editable-text-element&quot; data-v-b92e6724=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and integrate Embedded C/C++ software for ARM-based platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring up target hardware and integrate Yocto-based Board Support Packages, including bootloader, Linux Kernel, Device Tree, drivers and peripheral interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain Yocto layers, BitBake recipes and reproducible build, flashing and deployment environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug complex hardware and software issues using GDB, JTAG, logs, traces and Linux performance tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze system performance, memory usage, startup behavior and I/O bottlenecks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support display, GPU, network and system integration in close collaboration with software, graphics and QA engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate technical topics with customers, hardware suppliers and platform vendors, document results and share knowledge within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
